The Toll is a 2020 Canadian horror thriller film directed by Michael Nader.

11
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
The film stars Jordan Hayes and Max Topplin, with James
McGowan and Rosemary Dunsmore in supporting roles.

12
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
It follows a young woman (Hayes) who, after hailing a late-night ride-share, finds herself trapped with a strange driver
(Topplin) on a deserted road, as the two become targets of a mysterious and malevolent force known as "The Toll Man".

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
The Toll premiered at the 2020 Bucheon International Fantastic Film
Festival and the South by Southwest Film Festival.

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
